@MiniMultiTenantPolicyApi_HostAddress = https://localhost:7243

### Tenant 1 retrieves its own customer policy (200 OK)
GET {{MiniMultiTenantPolicyApi_HostAddress}}/api/customers/101/policy
X-Tenant-Id: 1

### Tenant 2 attempts to access Tenant 1's customer policy (404 Not Found)
GET {{MiniMultiTenantPolicyApi_HostAddress}}/api/customers/101/policy
X-Tenant-Id: 2

### Tenant 1 policies expiring within 30 days (200 OK)
GET {{MiniMultiTenantPolicyApi_HostAddress}}/api/policies/expiring?withinDays=30
X-Tenant-Id: 1

### Tenant 2 policies expiring within 30 days (200 OK)
GET {{MiniMultiTenantPolicyApi_HostAddress}}/api/policies/expiring?withinDays=30
X-Tenant-Id: 2

### Bonus: Tenant 1 policy expiration (200 OK)
GET {{MiniMultiTenantPolicyApi_HostAddress}}/api/policies/1001/expiration
X-Tenant-Id: 1

### Bonus: Tenant 2 attempts to access Tenant 1's policy (404 Not Found)
GET {{MiniMultiTenantPolicyApi_HostAddress}}/api/policies/1001/expiration
X-Tenant-Id: 2

### Missing tenant header (400 Bad Request)
GET {{MiniMultiTenantPolicyApi_HostAddress}}/api/customers/101/policy

### Invalid tenant header (400 Bad Request)
GET {{MiniMultiTenantPolicyApi_HostAddress}}/api/customers/101/policy
X-Tenant-Id: abc

### Unknown tenant (400 Bad Request)
GET {{MiniMultiTenantPolicyApi_HostAddress}}/api/customers/101/policy
X-Tenant-Id: 99
